OL,3,AParamount settles lawsuit with US
OL,4,Astates, clearing way for $110bn merger
OL,5,Awith Warner Bros
OL,6,
OL,7,FParamount has also promised to create
OL,8,Fan editorial independence board to
OL,9,Foversee CBS News and CNN, the news
OL,10,Fnetwork owned by Warner Bros Discovery
OL,11,Fwhich was recently banned from the
OL,12,FWhite House by President Donald Trump.
OL,14,FThe deal clears one of the final
OL,15,Fhurdles for the merger that is set to
OL,16,Freshape Hollywood, combining legacy
OL,17,Fstudios, major streamers, and national
OL,18,Fnetworks.
